    "notes": "Advanced side (back of the modern 1964 card), flatbed scan (1435x1600, card in the top half) from a 2019 collector's post of his Bill Virdon Strat-O-Matic cards (Wayback capture); read from a 0.62x whole-scan overview, then a second independent pass over 1.3x per-grid crops. Situation glyphs captured as markers: upTriangle (LHP col1 r3, RHP col1 r3; default popout plus the italic SI*/lo split printed beneath), downTriangle (LHP col1 r10, col3 r3; RHP col1 r4, col3 r11), omega (LHP col2 r12, col3 r5/r8/r10; RHP col3 r2/r7/r8), diamond (LHP col3 r2/r11). '?' after fly balls captured as questionMark; underlined C as 'underline:C'. 'plus injury' on LHP col1 r12 and RHP col2 r2."
